 replaces both the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]immediate tab refresh and the `,y` full-history refresh, adds a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]provider usage-window refresh and an everything sweep, shows each [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]option's real freshness, and keeps the old gestures reachable [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]behind a sunset flag until the panel has soaked.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]refresh_panel.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-100[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-100/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Surface freshness recorder[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]freshness[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]freshness: add the in-memory per-surface \"last reloaded\" recorder, stamp[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it from the auto-refresh sweep and the manual agents/artifacts/axe [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refresh paths, and expose a pure formatter for relative freshness [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]labels.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Refresh panel modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after freshness[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel: build the RefreshPanelModal single-key chooser, its rows, cursor,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]banner, availability states, worker-loaded usage freshness, styles, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]modal exports.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gesture rewiring behind the refresh_panel flag[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: create the sunset refresh_panel flag, route R and `,y` through the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel when it is on, execute each chosen option, and keep today's direct[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gestures as the off branch.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and visual snapshot[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]finish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]finish: document the panel in docs/ace.md, correct the stale refresh-key[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prose, add the PNG visual snapshot, and run the full verification gate.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-100","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-100.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-54791f9d8e6ae6fa15747b4314e49276","started_at":"2026-09-12T18:59:13.383514+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"3ac7bdfcfbd56ff1e6203ea974eab8fac97b082c77842054c1b04a2e194580d6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-100.3--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":3273},"commits":{"digest":"eeb2279daa40dd8f0845c29c410eca9ec992ddf2bdb870e1315dc4f9a5ac2934","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-100.3--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-100.3--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"6c91810fb27de